stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Initializing: ProcessVideo() called
    
    Initializing --> EnvironmentCheck: Start initialization
    EnvironmentCheck --> SAM3Init: Environment OK
    EnvironmentCheck --> Error: Environment invalid
    
    SAM3Init --> VLMInit: SAM 3 ready
    SAM3Init --> Error: SAM 3 failed
    
    VLMInit --> VideoLoading: VLM ready (or placeholder)
    VLMInit --> VideoLoading: VLM failed (use placeholder)
    
    VideoLoading --> DetectionPhase: Video loaded
    VideoLoading --> Error: Video load failed
    
    DetectionPhase --> HandDetection: Start detection
    HandDetection --> ObjectDetection: Hands detected
    ObjectDetection --> ProcessingPhase: Object detected
    
    ProcessingPhase --> ReadingFrame: Start frame loop
    ReadingFrame --> MaskRetrieval: Frame read
    ReadingFrame --> Cleanup: End of video
    
    MaskRetrieval --> VLMCheck: Masks retrieved
    VLMCheck --> VLMProcessing: Interval reached
    VLMCheck --> Visualization: Use cached
    
    VLMProcessing --> Visualization: VLM complete
    Visualization --> Display: Annotated frame ready
    Display --> Writing: Frame displayed
    Writing --> ReadingFrame: Frame written/processed
    
    Cleanup --> [*]: Processing complete
    Error --> [*]: Error occurred
    
    note right of VLMCheck
        VLM runs every N frames
        (default: 30)
    end note
    
    note right of DetectionPhase
        Two separate SAM 3 sessions:
        1. Hand detection
        2. Object detection
    end note
